### REST API samples (VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio .http files)
### The dev API key below is only configured in appsettings.Development.json (as a SHA-256 hash).
@base = http://localhost:5016
@key = dev-erp-gateway-key-ChangeMe

### One asset (JSON)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/assets/60110630
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Accept: application/json

### One asset (XML)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/assets/60110630
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Accept: application/xml

### Autocomplete search, optionally filtered by farm
GET {{base}}/api/v1/assets/search?q=egg&farm=Meegoda
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Per-farm summary
GET {{base}}/api/v1/farms/summary
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Health (anonymous, used by IIS deploy script and monitoring)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{base}}/openapi/v1.json
